# Git author for this project

All commits in this repo must be authored as:

- **Name:** `dikshadamahe`
- **Email:** `dikshadamahe1@gmail.com`

## Required behavior

- When committing, always set author for that command only (do **not** run `git config`):

```powershell
git -c user.name="dikshadamahe" -c user.email="dikshadamahe1@gmail.com" commit -m "message"
```

- Or use:

```powershell
git commit --author="dikshadamahe <dikshadamahe1@gmail.com>" -m "message"
```

  Prefer the `-c user.name` / `-c user.email` form so **both author and committer** match.

- Never commit as `Pracheer` or any other identity in this project.
- After committing, push to `origin` when the user asks to push.
- If a just-created local commit has the wrong author and has **not** been pushed, amend with the correct `-c user.name` / `-c user.email` (and `--reset-author`) only when amend rules allow.
